      "orm_identifier": "SAW-2026-00878",
      "district_code": "SAW",
      "county": "Person County",
      "county_basis": "USACE RRS",
      "comments_end": "2026-12-14",
      "source_description": "Interested parties are notified that the U.S. Army Corps of Engineers, Wilmington District has received an application for a Department of the Army permit pursuant to Section 404 of the Clean Water Act. The purpose of this public notice is to solicit comments from the public and information necessary to evaluate the probable impact on the public interest regarding a proposed data center. The applicant is requesting a permit for the permanent discharge of fill material into 0.47 acre of wetland, 0.29 ac (4,045 linear feet [lf]) of stream and the permanent-no permanent loss of 0.012 ac (11 lf) of stream for the construction of four one-story data center buildings, two logistics centers, one campus amenities building that will contain multiple storage servers, an on-site electrical substation and substation logistics center, sewage treatment, detention ponds and associated infrastructure.",
      "notice_id": 13569733,
